OL,6,G0300 The Summit
OL,7,     FThe group has now been reduced
OL,8,     Ffrom 14 to 11 as brutal hikes and
OL,9,     Ftreacherous crossings prove too
OL,10,     Fmuch for some. After they grapple
OL,11,     Fwith who should leave the mountain
OL,12,     Fat the first vote-off, the
